1
00:00:20,832 --> 00:00:22,656
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:43,552
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,744 --> 00:00:46,816
=Episode 23=

4
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,640
When will you let me go?

5
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:10,840
Ke.

6
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,680
I'm not Zhao Ke.

7
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:14,879
I'm Jiang...

8
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:36,200
I'm sorry.

9
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:39,719
I didn't mean to hurt you.

10
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,159
I'm sorry.

11
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:47,000
Luckily...

12
00:01:49,439 --> 00:01:51,319
Luckily, it's just a scratch.

13
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,319
Don't touch me.

14
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,879
Zhang Haotian.

15
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,719
Turn yourself in.

16
00:02:24,719 --> 00:02:25,599
It hurts, doesn't it?

17
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,159
Turn yourself in.

18
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,400
It must hurt.

19
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:31,159
Painful.

20
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:34,680
How could it not hurt?

21
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,879
This is my secret hideout.

22
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,560
I found it the year I almost froze
to death.

23
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,520
Get some rest.

24
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:55,719
Don't think about anything.

25
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,680
Get some rest.

26
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,680
Go on.

27
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,759
(Ms. Lin,)

28
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,560
(Zhang Haotian took Zhao Ke.)

29
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:11,000
(Our men lost track of them.)

30
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:11,919
(We currently)

31
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,159
(don't know where they went.)

32
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:14,639
Got it.

33
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:25,240
I told you my secret hideout.

34
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,560
You have to tell me yours too.

35
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,240
Not just tell me,

36
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:30,280
you have to take me there.

37
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,159
I don't take my girlfriend there.

38
00:03:35,919 --> 00:03:36,960
No.

39
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:39,080
I only take my wife there.

40
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,479
Having a home and someone to love,

41
00:03:58,719 --> 00:04:00,039
taking walks together,

42
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,599
going shopping together,

43
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,080
having children,

44
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,680
giving them warmth,

45
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,280
and passing that warmth on...

46
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:07,719
That would be wonderful.

47
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,080
Ke.

48
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,400
I told Lin Lulu I was an orphan.

49
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:15,120
But I wasn't actually an orphan.

50
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,759
I had my own parents.

51
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,480
But they already had their own families.

52
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:23,879
I was like a ball,

53
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:25,399
being kicked back and forth
between them.

54
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,279
Later, they disappeared.

55
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,160
I was five years old that year.

56
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,480
It was winter.

57
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:38,600
When my adoptive father found me,

58
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,480
my mouth was already full of ice.

59
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,920
My adoptive father was very kind to me.

60
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:48,160
He treated me like his own son.

61
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,959
I thought he must have had a child
of his own.

62
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:54,120
He always seemed troubled,

63
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,680
but he never told me why.

64
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,800
Then he died.

65
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:03,800
And I was alone again.

66
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,680
I went to the city and struggled
to survive.

67
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:12,480
Ke.

68
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:15,160
Do you think

69
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,000
I'm just rotten to the core?

70
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,199
Aren't you?

71
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,839
I don't think so.

72
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,920
I struggled to survive
for eighteen years.

73
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:28,279
I never had a single evil thought.

74
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:30,120
All I ever wanted was warmth.

75
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:33,079
I just wanted to feel warmth.

76
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:35,759
But

77
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:38,720
I couldn't take it anymore.

78
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,000
I just couldn't.

79
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:42,360
That guy, Wang...

80
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,680
that scumbag treated me like a dog!

81
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:45,240
He...

82
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,439
He was the last straw.

83
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:53,800
From that moment on,

84
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,399
I swore

85
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,680
we would become rich and powerful.

86
00:06:01,199 --> 00:06:03,319
We would never live at the mercy
of others again.

87
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:07,920
You said all that nonsense

88
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:11,160
just to make me pity you?

89
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,519
I wanted you to understand me.

90
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:17,240
Then do you want to understand me?

91
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,600
I already know you well enough.

92
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:25,480
Ever since I found out you were
my adoptive father's daughter,

93
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,240
do you know how happy I was?

94
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,800
I've never had love.

95
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,639
And I don't long for it either.

96
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,040
By the way, Ke,

97
00:06:36,519 --> 00:06:39,079
could you say you love me?

98
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:46,720
For your own wealth and status,

99
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,480
you tricked me into giving up a kidney!

100
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:53,040
You destroyed my dream
of becoming a dancer!

101
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:55,959
You turned me into a woman

102
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:56,839
trapped in madness!

103
00:06:58,319 --> 00:07:00,319
And you still have the nerve
to ask me to say I love you?

104
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:01,480
How dare you?

105
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:03,920
Say it.

106
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:05,800
Say you love me.

107
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,360
I love you.

108
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,519
You think you're worthy of my love?

109
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:25,160
Actually,

110
00:07:26,079 --> 00:07:28,079
you knew I was Jiang Lai all along,
didn't you?

111
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:31,720
That's why you were afraid
of Chen Ping investigating me.

112
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,839
Because it would shatter the fantasy
you created for yourself.

113
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,920
Deep down, you wanted so badly
for me to be Zhao Ke.

114
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:43,480
You even dreamed that I was
your adoptive father's daughter.

115
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:46,480
But I'm not.

116
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,279
I'm not Zhao Ke.

117
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:52,720
I'm Jiang Lai.

118
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:56,839
I'm Jiang Lai, the woman who wants
to tear you apart!

119
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:04,160
Why won't you say you love me?

120
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:09,480
If you want me to love you,

121
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,879
it will only happen after I'm dead.

122
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,920
I'll take you somewhere.

123
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,360
(The Cornered Beast Strikes Back)

124
00:08:51,992 --> 00:08:56,890
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

125
00:08:57,176 --> 00:09:00,590
♪I should forget you♪

126
00:09:00,672 --> 00:09:05,520
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

127
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,664
♪To carry on♪

128
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:13,152
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

129
00:09:13,216 --> 00:09:15,630
♪You no longer have the strength♪

130
00:09:17,144 --> 00:09:20,160
♪You want me to go there for you♪

131
00:09:21,656 --> 00:09:27,120
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

132
00:09:27,736 --> 00:09:31,120
♪Your freedom♪

133
00:09:31,176 --> 00:09:36,190
♪Has become my cage♪

134
00:09:36,744 --> 00:09:43,710
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

135
00:09:43,896 --> 00:09:49,260
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

136
00:09:50,056 --> 00:09:56,140
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

137
00:09:56,360 --> 00:10:01,112
♪You told me♪

138
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:05,410
♪I would shine like a star♪

139
00:10:05,496 --> 00:10:09,200
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

140
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:13,570
♪How to live without you♪

141
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:19,776
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

142
00:10:21,184 --> 00:10:24,280
♪So hazy and blurred♪
